Parity tests against the R port. Mirrors ../R_package/spmixW/inst/validation/.

Convention:
  validation_01_ols.do         - ports validation_01_ols.R
  validation_02_sar.do         - ports validation_02_sar.R
  ...
  run_all_validations.do       - runs all and writes a diff report

Each script:
  1. Generates input from a fixed seed (must match the R script's seed)
  2. Runs the Stata estimator
  3. Loads R-side reference output (saved to ../R_package/spmixW/inst/validation/ref/*.csv)
  4. Diffs key statistics against the tolerances in PLAN.md
